BT /B 22 Tf 52 790 Td (Burnout Insight ? Complete Website and Repository Guide) Tj ET
BT /B 15 Tf 52 749 Td (1. What Burnout Insight is) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 715 Td (Burnout Insight is an English-only browser website for learning about exhaustion, work) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 702 Td (pressure, and possible workplace causes. It is designed as a private educational self-check,) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 689 Td (not as a medical or psychological diagnosis.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 670 Td (The website helps a person:) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 651 Td (- Notice personal exhaustion patterns.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 638 Td (- Notice exhaustion connected with work.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 625 Td (- Review workplace conditions that may add pressure.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 612 Td (- Understand what the scores mean in simple language.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 599 Td (- Choose practical next steps.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 586 Td (- Save and review complete reports later.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 573 Td (- Track small actions with a private seven-day plan.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 554 Td (It works as a standalone website. There is no required account, server, login, or database.) Tj ET
BT /B 15 Tf 52 535 Td (2. What the website can do) Tj ET
BT /B 12 Tf 52 501 Td (Full 25-question assessment) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 471 Td (The full survey contains 25 questions in a mixed random order:) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 452 Td (- 13 CBI exhaustion questions.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 439 Td (- 12 workplace questions.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 420 Td (The questions are not shown as ?all personal first, then all work? questions. They are mixed to) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 407 Td (make the assessment feel more natural.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 388 Td (The survey provides:) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 369 Td (- One question at a time.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 356 Td (- Progress indicator.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 343 Td (- Question-specific practical advice.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 330 Td (- Two live meters during the survey.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 317 Td (- Colored lower, elevated, and higher ranges.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 304 Td (- Enter-key submission after an answer is selected.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 291 Td (- Back navigation and the ability to change an answer.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 278 Td (- Responsive layout for desktop and mobile.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 259 Td (The live meters are:) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 240 Td (1. Personal burnout ? based on the 13 CBI exhaustion questions.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 227 Td (2. Work-related burnout ? based on the 12 workplace questions in the live survey view.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 208 Td (The final report also calculates the official CBI personal and CBI work-related scores) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 195 Td (separately, together with the six workplace-area scores.) Tj ET
BT /B 12 Tf 52 176 Td (Immediate Support) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 146 Td (Immediate Support is a shorter focused survey for a specific concern. Available areas include:) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 127 Td (- Workload.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 114 Td (- Control and decision-making.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 101 Td (- Coworker tension or conflict.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 88 Td (- Exhaustion and energy.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 69 Td (Each focused report can show:) Tj ET
endstream
