BT /B 15 Tf 52 421 Td (3. Methods and models covered) Tj ET
BT /B 12 Tf 52 387 Td (Copenhagen Burnout Inventory \(CBI\)) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 357 Td (The CBI is used to structure the exhaustion questions. It separates:) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 338 Td (- Personal burnout ? general physical and emotional exhaustion.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 325 Td (- Work-related burnout ? exhaustion connected with work.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 306 Td (The CBI questions use five answer choices. The application converts them to:) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 287 Td (100, 75, 50, 25, 0) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 268 Td (The personal score averages P01?P06. The work-related CBI score averages W01?W07. W07 is) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 255 Td (reverse-scored because having more energy for family and friends during leisure time indicates) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 242 Td (less work-related exhaustion.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 223 Td (The website explains that a higher score means more reported exhaustion on this educational) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 210 Td (scale. It does not convert the score into a probability of having burnout.) Tj ET
BT /B 12 Tf 52 191 Td (Six Areas of Worklife) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 161 Td (The 12 project-created workplace questions are organized into six workplace areas:) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 142 Td (1. Workload ? amount, pace, deadlines, and time pressure.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 129 Td (2. Control ? influence, autonomy, decision-making, and flexibility.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 116 Td (3. Reward ? recognition, feedback, and whether effort feels valued.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 103 Td (4. Community ? relationships, communication, teamwork, and support.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 90 Td (5. Fairness ? consistency, transparency, and fair treatment.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 77 Td (6. Values ? alignment between work practices and professional values.) Tj ET
endstream
