BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 531 Td (- Higher ? 67 and above.) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 512 Td (These are visual communication bands created for the project. They are not medical cutoffs and) Tj ET
BT /R 9.2 Tf 52 499 Td (do not determine whether someone has burnout.) Tj ET
